before	<col=000080>I can start this quest by talking to <col=800000>Patzi</col> outside <col=800000>Villa Lucens</col> on <col=800000>Aldarin</col>.</col>
step	1	-	Getting a uniform
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Patzi</col> on <col=800000>Aldarin</col>. He asked me to help him sneak into a <col=800000>Party</col> at <col=800000>Villa Lucens</col> by posing as his <col=800000>Butler</col>. To do so, I'll need to obtain a <col=800000>Butler's Uniform</col>. According to <col=800000>Patzi's</col> bag carrier, <col=800000>Adala</col>, a <col=800000>Villa</col> to the north might contain some <col=800000>Uniforms</col>.</col>
step	2	-	After getting a uniform
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Patzi</col> on <col=800000>Aldarin</col>. He asked me to help him sneak into a <col=800000>Party</col> at <col=800000>Villa Lucens</col> by posing as his <col=800000>Butler</col>. To do so, I followed advice from <col=800000>Patzi's</col> bag carrier, <col=800000>Adala</col>, and obtained a <col=800000>Butler's Uniform</col> from a <col=800000>Villa</col> on the north side of the island. I should now return to <col=800000>Patzi</col> and <col=800000>Adala</col>.</col>
step	3	-	Getting inside the villa
line	<str>I spoke to Patzi on Aldarin. He asked me to help him sneak into a Party at Villa Lucens by posing as his Butler. To do so, I followed advice from Patzi's bag carrier, Adala, and obtained a Butler's Uniform from a Villa on the north side of the island.</str>
line	<col=000080>With my <col=800000>Butler's Uniform</col> obtained, I'm now ready to go to the <col=800000>Party</col>. According to <col=800000>Patzi</col>, I'll need to use the <col=800000>Staff Entrance</col> to enter <col=800000>Villa Lucens</col>.</col>
step	4	-	Inside the villa
line	<str>I spoke to Patzi on Aldarin. He asked me to help him sneak into a Party at Villa Lucens by posing as his Butler. To do so, I followed advice from Patzi's bag carrier, Adala, and obtained a Butler's Uniform from a Villa on the north side of the island.</str>
line	<col=000080>With my <col=800000>Butler's Uniform</col> obtained, I used the <col=800000>Staff Entrance</col> to enter <col=800000>Villa Lucens</col>. I should meet up with <col=800000>Patzi</col> inside.</col>
