line	<str>I spoke to Patzi on Aldarin. He asked me to help him sneak into a Party at Villa Lucens by posing as his Butler. To do so, I followed advice from Patzi's bag carrier, Adala, and obtained a Butler's Uniform from a Villa on the north side of the island.</str>
line	<col=000080>With my <col=800000>Butler's Uniform</col> obtained, I used the <col=800000>Staff Entrance</col> to enter <col=800000>Villa Lucens</col>. I met up with <col=800000>Patzi</col> inside and he asked me to gather information on the <col=800000>Host</col> and the <col=800000>Guests</col> for him. I should go around and speak to them all.</col>
