line	<str>I spoke to Patzi on Aldarin. He asked me to help him sneak into a Party at Villa Lucens by posing as his Butler. To do so, I followed advice from Patzi's bag carrier, Adala, and obtained a Butler's Uniform from a Villa on the north side of the island.</str>
