line	<str>At Patzi's request, I entered the Wine Cellar to find some Principum Red. I found some, but ended up spilling it due to a Loud Crashing Sound coming from elsewhere in the Cellar. I investigated and found a Man lying on the floor. Before I could do anything else, I was arrested by two guards.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Stradius</col> and <col=800000>Hutza</col>, the <col=800000>Guards</col> who arrested me, revealed that the <col=800000>Man</col> I found had been murdered. They also revealed him to be <col=800000>Livius</col>, an actor who was meant to be performing in a play at the <col=800000>Villa</col> as part of the <col=800000>Party</col>. I managed to convince them I was innocent and they agreed to let me help find the real <col=800000>Killer</col>. To do so, I should investigate the <col=800000>Wine Cellar</col> and question the <col=800000>Suspects</col>. Once I'm satisfied that I've found everything of note, I should let <col=800000>Stradius</col> and <col=800000>Hutza</col> know.</col>
