line	<col=000080>With <col=800000>Adala</col> dealt with, <col=800000>Constantinius</col> decided to go ahead with the <col=800000>Play</col>. As we don't know if <col=800000>Adala</col> was guilty, I'll need to continue my investigation. <col=800000>Constantinius</col> doesn't want any more disruptions, so I'll need to use the <col=800000>Cliffside Path</col> south of the <col=800000>Villa</col> to reach the <col=800000>Theatre</col>.</col>
