line	<str>With Adala dealt with, Constantinius decided to go ahead with the Play. With the Killer potentially still at large, I decided to continue my investigation. Constantinius didn't want any disruptions, so I had to use the Cliffside Path south of the Villa to reach the Theatre.</str>
