line	<str>At Patzi's request, I entered the Wine Cellar to find some Principum Red. I found some, but ended up spilling it due to a Loud Crashing Sound coming from elsewhere in the Cellar. I investigated and found a Man lying on the floor. Before I could do anything else, I was arrested by two guards.</str>
line	<str>Stradius and Hutza, the Guards who arrested me, revealed that the Man I found had been murdered. They also revealed him to be Livius, an actor who was meant to be performing in a play at the Villa as part of the Party. I managed to convince them I was innocent and they agreed to let me help find the real Killer.</str>
