line	<col=000080>I searched the <col=800000>Backstage Area</col> and found some new clues. With them, I came to the conclusion that <col=800000>Naiatli</col>, <col=800000>Livius'</col> understudy, was the one responsible for his death. When I'm ready to confront her, I should speak to <col=800000>Stradius</col> and <col=800000>Hutza</col>.</col>
